1
00:00:13,596 --> 00:00:17,350
Then Jolyne got punished on purpose
so that she gets confined

2
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:20,311
at the Disciplinary Wing to find the bone!

3
00:00:20,395 --> 00:00:21,396
Yes.

4
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:26,776
If I successfully protect her to the end,
then I will marry her.

5
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,319
This is my condition.

6
00:00:28,945 --> 00:00:30,071
Got that?

7
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,490
Diver Drive!

8
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:44,502
Give us your blessing.

9
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:49,549
The electric potential sending
signals to the nervous system

10
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:51,760
is very small, at 70mV.

11
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:54,637
This Stand dwells in
that slight pulse of energy.

12
00:00:55,138 --> 00:01:00,018
Survivor's attack is mostly unnoticed,
and it doesn't cause any harm.

13
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:02,270
It simply awakens its victim's anger.

14
00:02:35,071 --> 00:02:40,743
EPISODE 16: THE SECRET OF GUARD WESTWOOD

15
00:02:52,422 --> 00:02:54,299
Bastards!

16
00:02:56,134 --> 00:02:57,969
I can see

17
00:02:58,052 --> 00:03:02,682
the strongest parts
of each fighter's body from here!

18
00:03:03,224 --> 00:03:05,310
It's Fight Club time!

19
00:03:05,935 --> 00:03:08,187
Let's brawl!

20
00:03:17,572 --> 00:03:23,661
I've always found you irritating, fuckers!

21
00:03:24,704 --> 00:03:29,334
The enemy User must be among them.

22
00:03:29,918 --> 00:03:34,047
One of them manipulated
the guards into fighting.

23
00:03:34,672 --> 00:03:39,135
The bone lurking somewhere within
this Ultra Security House Unit…

24
00:03:39,218 --> 00:03:41,137
I'll do anything it takes to make it mine!

25
00:03:41,679 --> 00:03:44,557
I won't let anyone stand in my way.

26
00:03:44,641 --> 00:03:47,518
If anyone dares, I will kill--

27
00:03:48,603 --> 00:03:50,939
Hold on… kill?

28
00:03:51,022 --> 00:03:53,775
Did I really think that just now?

29
00:03:53,858 --> 00:03:56,611
This burning feeling awakening within me…

30
00:03:57,111 --> 00:04:00,031
Is this my fighting spirit?
It urges me to conquer all

31
00:04:00,114 --> 00:04:03,409
no matter who I'm up against
or what happens to me.

32
00:04:03,493 --> 00:04:04,994
Why do I feel so aggressive?

33
00:04:10,124 --> 00:04:11,626
This prison guard…

34
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:16,798
Now, he wants to do to me
what he did to the other guard.

35
00:04:16,881 --> 00:04:20,760
But that's fine.
He's no match for my Stone Ocean.

36
00:04:35,316 --> 00:04:37,068
Stone Ocean!

37
00:04:49,831 --> 00:04:53,918
I can see it, FE40536.

38
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:55,545
I can see your strongest point.

39
00:04:55,628 --> 00:05:00,508
It's the thread-like thing
coming out of your muscles.

40
00:05:00,591 --> 00:05:02,427
It's beautiful.

41
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:05,263
So that's your strongest power.

42
00:05:06,848 --> 00:05:08,474
His movements just now…

43
00:05:08,558 --> 00:05:13,313
Though his fight with the other guard
was uncanny and brutal,

44
00:05:13,396 --> 00:05:15,606
it was still just a brawl.

45
00:05:15,690 --> 00:05:17,025
But now,

46
00:05:17,817 --> 00:05:20,194
his movements are beyond
what humans can do!

47
00:05:20,278 --> 00:05:24,615
I have to defeat him with all my power
as fast as I can!

48
00:05:33,374 --> 00:05:35,501
The guard's muscles…

49
00:05:35,585 --> 00:05:37,503
They are shining beautifully.

50
00:05:38,296 --> 00:05:41,716
Also, the sequence
of his movements just now…

51
00:05:42,216 --> 00:05:45,261
How is a human capable
of ignoring fear and pain

52
00:05:45,344 --> 00:05:47,972
to exert that much force
when attacking and jumping?

53
00:05:48,598 --> 00:05:51,851
But if the beautiful lights
emanating from his muscles

54
00:05:51,934 --> 00:05:55,229
indicate his strongest parts,

55
00:05:55,313 --> 00:05:58,399
then that leg of his right now…

56
00:05:58,483 --> 00:06:00,818
That's the leg I attacked.

57
00:06:00,902 --> 00:06:02,737
My attack was effective!

58
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:03,946
I can feel it.

59
00:06:04,489 --> 00:06:07,366
I can tell that my attack
did some deep damage to his leg!

60
00:06:10,286 --> 00:06:11,662
Bastard.

61
00:06:11,746 --> 00:06:14,582
Who said you can walk in front of me?

62
00:06:14,665 --> 00:06:16,417
You're pissing me off!

63
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:18,711
The others have started fighting too.

64
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:21,881
Take this!

65
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:27,095
Damn prison guard!

66
00:06:27,178 --> 00:06:31,599
I must incapacitate him as quickly
as I can and focus on finding the bone!

67
00:06:42,944 --> 00:06:44,946
Good thing you didn't wring your own neck

68
00:06:45,029 --> 00:06:46,197
with that swing of yours.

69
00:06:58,334 --> 00:07:00,419
Now, just stay there!

70
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,559
What the hell just happened?

71
00:07:14,642 --> 00:07:16,352
How did he attack me?

72
00:07:16,936 --> 00:07:19,313
This prison guard!

73
00:07:19,397 --> 00:07:21,023
What did you do just now?

74
00:07:23,067 --> 00:07:24,527
This is…

75
00:07:25,278 --> 00:07:27,697
So he is also a Stand User.

76
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:31,033
There's more than one User
in this Disciplinary Wing.

77
00:07:31,784 --> 00:07:35,496
He already had a Stand on a disc!

78
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:39,709
But what did he do, and how?

79
00:07:40,293 --> 00:07:43,546
I left him no chance to counter me.

80
00:07:43,629 --> 00:07:48,050
And I didn't see his Stand,
so how did he attack me?

81
00:07:48,634 --> 00:07:49,886
It's deep.

82
00:07:49,969 --> 00:07:51,721
Fuck, it's deep.

83
00:07:51,804 --> 00:07:56,684
He can't leave a wound this deep
with a stashed razor blade or a knife.

84
00:07:56,767 --> 00:07:58,936
Just what did he do to me?

85
00:08:01,981 --> 00:08:06,360
If he has a power-type Stand,
then I should be able to see it!

86
00:08:06,444 --> 00:08:09,071
FE40536.

87
00:08:09,155 --> 00:08:10,823
You use threads to attack.

88
00:08:10,907 --> 00:08:15,369
I see threads
and a bundle of them in your body.

89
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:19,874
Your strongest power comes
from using this ability.

90
00:08:19,957 --> 00:08:21,751
That's what makes you strong.

91
00:08:23,044 --> 00:08:24,712
How beautiful.

92
00:08:26,964 --> 00:08:28,466
I can see your shine.

93
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:34,889
When did you become a Stand User?

94
00:08:34,972 --> 00:08:36,474
Yesterday?

95
00:08:36,557 --> 00:08:37,558
Or a moment ago?

96
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,030
I saw it!

97
00:08:52,406 --> 00:08:53,616
I saw his Stand!

98
00:08:53,699 --> 00:08:56,202
His Stand took form!

99
00:09:00,122 --> 00:09:01,249
A Stand User…

100
00:09:01,791 --> 00:09:07,046
So this bastard is the assassin
sent to eliminate me.

101
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:12,552
Strings do not require power to defend.

102
00:09:12,635 --> 00:09:17,431
A punch's straight trajectory
can easily be changed

103
00:09:17,515 --> 00:09:19,517
by throwing it off by just a little.

104
00:09:22,436 --> 00:09:23,563
Right into my trap.

105
00:09:23,646 --> 00:09:27,817
Now that you've used both of your arms,
I can restrict all your movements.

106
00:09:29,277 --> 00:09:30,194
In other words…

107
00:09:36,450 --> 00:09:38,869
you'll get covered with my jacket.

108
00:09:38,953 --> 00:09:39,996
Stone Ocean!

109
00:09:46,877 --> 00:09:49,005
I won't let you get back up.

110
00:09:59,265 --> 00:10:01,267
Wha… what?

111
00:10:01,934 --> 00:10:03,269
It's happening again!

112
00:10:03,978 --> 00:10:06,939
What does his Stand do?

113
00:10:07,023 --> 00:10:09,650
No, I can't see it! What did it do?

114
00:10:11,861 --> 00:10:12,987
I have you now!

115
00:10:14,447 --> 00:10:17,742
You're just a piece of shit.

116
00:10:17,825 --> 00:10:21,203
You've made a fool out of me.

117
00:10:21,287 --> 00:10:23,039
How dare you.

118
00:10:23,623 --> 00:10:25,791
Prisoners are the scum of society.

119
00:10:25,875 --> 00:10:30,379
Nothing infuriates me more than
scum like you treating me like shit.

120
00:10:31,172 --> 00:10:34,842
I spent every day on duty
irritated like this.

121
00:10:34,925 --> 00:10:36,260
How dare you look down on me.

122
00:10:36,344 --> 00:10:38,679
I'll make you pay.

123
00:10:38,763 --> 00:10:40,264
I'm not holding back anymore!

124
00:10:40,348 --> 00:10:41,974
I'll release my anger now.

125
00:10:42,058 --> 00:10:43,934
I won't hold anything back.

126
00:10:44,018 --> 00:10:46,854
I'll make sure you pay.

127
00:10:46,937 --> 00:10:48,064
I am the strongest!

128
00:10:48,147 --> 00:10:54,403
I'm going crazy,
and you're going to get it!

129
00:10:59,283 --> 00:11:00,409
What's that on the ceiling window?

130
00:11:00,993 --> 00:11:03,746
No, so his Stand is…

131
00:11:03,829 --> 00:11:05,039
This isn't good!

132
00:11:05,122 --> 00:11:06,332
At this rate, I'll be…

133
00:11:06,415 --> 00:11:08,876
I have to get away!

134
00:11:08,959 --> 00:11:12,880
His Stand's attack is coming towards me!

135
00:11:14,548 --> 00:11:15,966
I got you now.

136
00:11:16,050 --> 00:11:17,218
I've completely locked you in.

137
00:11:22,723 --> 00:11:25,935
Did you forget that I'm a prison guard?

138
00:11:26,018 --> 00:11:29,730
I detain prisoners
almost every day at my job.

139
00:11:29,814 --> 00:11:32,441
Your right hand may seem to be free,

140
00:11:32,525 --> 00:11:37,363
but this headlock does more than choke.

141
00:11:37,446 --> 00:11:40,908
I'm also twisting the joint
on your left shoulder

142
00:11:41,992 --> 00:11:45,454
so that your right arm goes dead
and doesn't rise.

143
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:50,042
Your right hand won't reach my face.

144
00:11:50,626 --> 00:11:56,298
This headlock has one weakness,
which I know very well.

145
00:11:57,591 --> 00:12:01,887
Your right hand is free to grab my balls.

146
00:12:01,971 --> 00:12:04,849
Of course, I wouldn't mind that
if the situation were different.

147
00:12:06,725 --> 00:12:09,395
But I can even block that too!

148
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:13,607
It's coming!

149
00:12:14,233 --> 00:12:18,571
If I don't do something,
his Stand's true form will…

150
00:12:19,155 --> 00:12:20,281
That ceiling!

151
00:12:20,865 --> 00:12:24,160
The ceiling window's hard glass…

152
00:12:24,243 --> 00:12:25,744
Those cracks!

153
00:12:27,705 --> 00:12:28,706
I have to break free!

154
00:12:28,789 --> 00:12:30,416
Stone Ocean!

155
00:12:32,293 --> 00:12:33,586
I tore his eardrum!

156
00:12:33,669 --> 00:12:35,254
His grip loosened!

157
00:12:37,339 --> 00:12:41,093
The universe is full of countless
space rocks and debris.

158
00:12:41,719 --> 00:12:45,931
Many of such rocks are drawn in
by the gravitational pull of the earth.

159
00:12:46,807 --> 00:12:50,603
While the majority disintegrate
before reaching the surface,

160
00:12:50,686 --> 00:12:51,770
what if the meteorites

161
00:12:51,854 --> 00:12:56,358
could retain optimal angle and speed
while entering the atmosphere?

162
00:13:08,245 --> 00:13:09,914
STAND NAME: STARLIGHT WAVES
STAND MASTER: VIVANO WESTWOOD

163
00:13:36,106 --> 00:13:38,317
Oh, so you're coming too.

164
00:13:38,901 --> 00:13:40,778
I can do this by myself.

165
00:13:40,861 --> 00:13:44,782
I make and call the shots around here.

166
00:13:44,865 --> 00:13:50,037
Yes, I asked for your help,
but let's make that clear.

167
00:13:52,748 --> 00:13:57,836
Also, if Pale Snake really is determined
to eliminate Jolyne,

168
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:02,925
he must have sent two assassins,
no, even more than that.

169
00:14:03,676 --> 00:14:06,595
There must be at least
three Stand Users after Jolyne's life.

170
00:14:07,179 --> 00:14:12,434
You and I will get rid of them,
then meet back here.

171
00:14:12,518 --> 00:14:13,477
Got that?

172
00:14:14,478 --> 00:14:15,729
Fine.

173
00:14:17,189 --> 00:14:20,985
I plan to be back
before that guard wakes up.

174
00:14:23,028 --> 00:14:26,949
Also, we already agreed that
I'll marry Jolyne.

175
00:14:27,032 --> 00:14:29,201
Don't forget that.

176
00:14:32,872 --> 00:14:34,164
Yeah, so about that…

177
00:14:34,248 --> 00:14:37,084
What the hell do you mean?
I really don't get you.

178
00:15:02,568 --> 00:15:03,694
Meteorites!

179
00:15:03,777 --> 00:15:09,199
His attacks are the meteorites
that are drawn to this prison guard!

180
00:15:09,283 --> 00:15:11,368
That's what was smashing into me.

181
00:15:11,952 --> 00:15:15,372
His Stand attracts meteorites from space.

182
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:19,835
But they always
burn away before they can hit him.

183
00:15:20,628 --> 00:15:23,380
And another one will fall.
He'll attract another one!

184
00:15:23,464 --> 00:15:24,590
Before that happens…

185
00:15:27,801 --> 00:15:29,053
I got you!

186
00:15:29,136 --> 00:15:32,306
This time, I won't let go!

187
00:15:32,389 --> 00:15:35,809
I'll be the victor, shining beautifully.

188
00:15:35,893 --> 00:15:39,521
I am the strongest!

189
00:15:40,189 --> 00:15:41,231
Stone Ocean!

190
00:15:47,237 --> 00:15:52,409
I'll strip off your skin from toe to head!

191
00:15:53,202 --> 00:15:57,873
Now let me go, you fucking guard!

192
00:16:04,546 --> 00:16:05,381
He loosened his grip!

193
00:16:20,521 --> 00:16:22,439
I barely dodged them.

194
00:16:22,523 --> 00:16:26,819
I tried to deflect the meteorites
toward him,

195
00:16:27,486 --> 00:16:29,113
but it's just like the last time.

196
00:16:29,196 --> 00:16:33,325
Not a single meteorite will hit him.

197
00:16:33,409 --> 00:16:36,203
They disintegrate the moment
before they hit him!

198
00:16:38,539 --> 00:16:40,541
That prison guard's Stand ability

199
00:16:40,624 --> 00:16:45,504
attracts the falling meteorites
toward his body like a magnet!

200
00:16:45,587 --> 00:16:48,882
But no matter what I try,

201
00:16:48,966 --> 00:16:54,304
the meteorites hit only me
when I get close to him.

202
00:16:54,388 --> 00:16:56,640
How bizarre.

203
00:16:56,724 --> 00:17:00,769
Burning rocks are falling
toward me from the sky.

204
00:17:00,853 --> 00:17:03,272
Are they meteorites?

205
00:17:03,355 --> 00:17:05,274
Could this be my strongest power?

206
00:17:07,443 --> 00:17:09,778
FE40536.

207
00:17:09,862 --> 00:17:11,947
How many of them have smashed into you?

208
00:17:12,031 --> 00:17:13,699
Your wounds look serious.

209
00:17:15,075 --> 00:17:19,830
They got both your arms,
your left ribs, and your right leg.

210
00:17:19,913 --> 00:17:21,623
So that's five times.

211
00:17:21,707 --> 00:17:23,083
Or is that six?

212
00:17:23,167 --> 00:17:28,380
The next one will be your fatal blow.

213
00:17:37,347 --> 00:17:38,724
What a bluff.

214
00:17:38,807 --> 00:17:43,645
You are barely able to stand right now.

215
00:17:44,438 --> 00:17:47,816
Not even, you are just trying
to fool me with that stance.

216
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:54,490
In truth, you can't fight me
with those arms anymore.

217
00:17:55,157 --> 00:17:59,703
Your arm muscles are pitch-black.

218
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:03,165
The muscles have really lost their shine.

219
00:18:03,749 --> 00:18:05,918
Why don't we fool around a bit?

220
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:10,964
Let's see how bad your damage is.

221
00:18:15,010 --> 00:18:16,887
What's the matter?

222
00:18:16,970 --> 00:18:19,973
Come on, give me a swing.

223
00:18:20,057 --> 00:18:21,767
I'm not even blocking.

224
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:24,812
Here, attack me.

225
00:18:24,895 --> 00:18:27,231
How do you want to punch me?

226
00:18:27,314 --> 00:18:30,275
I'll even close my eyes for you.

227
00:18:37,741 --> 00:18:38,909
Over there!

228
00:18:39,409 --> 00:18:41,245
That little thing he's got.

229
00:18:41,328 --> 00:18:44,206
That's the bone Pale Snake is after!

230
00:18:44,289 --> 00:18:47,167
That's the bone! It's right over there!

231
00:18:48,710 --> 00:18:52,548
You can't even fight anymore!

232
00:18:53,632 --> 00:18:57,511
You are using the wall
to block the meteorites.

233
00:18:57,594 --> 00:19:01,265
I knew you'd try that!

234
00:19:03,267 --> 00:19:05,644
Meteorites were already
crashing towards me

235
00:19:05,727 --> 00:19:07,980
from the other side of the wall!

236
00:19:14,444 --> 00:19:15,863
I won!

237
00:19:15,946 --> 00:19:21,535
I knew it, you are so damaged
that you can't even block my blows!

238
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:25,539
One stared at the wall

239
00:19:26,331 --> 00:19:31,003
While the other looked up at the stars
On the other side of the bars

240
00:19:33,088 --> 00:19:34,631
Which am I?

241
00:19:34,715 --> 00:19:38,635
And now, one more hit!

242
00:19:39,970 --> 00:19:41,346
The bone is right over there.

243
00:19:42,931 --> 00:19:46,602
I will do anything
to get close to Pale Snake.

244
00:19:47,186 --> 00:19:49,104
I'll even drink sewage water.

245
00:19:49,188 --> 00:19:52,065
I'll even become the strongest!

246
00:19:55,319 --> 00:19:56,987
I win!

247
00:19:57,779 --> 00:20:03,327
There's no way for you
to escape the meteorite now!

248
00:20:03,410 --> 00:20:05,579
Of course, I want to look up at the stars.

249
00:20:06,663 --> 00:20:10,500
I want to keep looking at them
until I see Dad again.

250
00:20:12,878 --> 00:20:14,463
Good grief.

251
00:20:14,546 --> 00:20:17,174
Here comes your final blow!

252
00:20:17,257 --> 00:20:20,219
You're done for!

253
00:20:20,302 --> 00:20:23,472
I can't dodge this final blow.

254
00:20:24,181 --> 00:20:27,768
I can't block it with Stone Ocean anymore.

255
00:20:27,851 --> 00:20:32,272
I am superior!

256
00:20:32,356 --> 00:20:33,523
But…

257
00:20:34,441 --> 00:20:37,486
I did manage to slip off your right shoe.

258
00:20:44,618 --> 00:20:49,039
She even put a brick in my boot!

259
00:20:49,122 --> 00:20:53,502
She took the hit,
but the damage was halved!

260
00:20:54,294 --> 00:20:55,671
She changed its course!

261
00:21:00,592 --> 00:21:02,678
The meteorite will disintegrate.

262
00:21:02,761 --> 00:21:05,055
It's impossible to hit you with it.

263
00:21:05,639 --> 00:21:08,600
I'm strictly speaking about
the meteorite, that is.

264
00:21:09,393 --> 00:21:10,811
My boot!

265
00:21:16,191 --> 00:21:19,528
Seriously, good grief.

266
00:21:22,656 --> 00:21:24,992
You bitch!

267
00:21:25,075 --> 00:21:26,118
Stone Ocean!

268
00:21:32,666 --> 00:21:37,421
What is up with this bitch?

269
00:21:37,504 --> 00:21:39,881
She really doesn't give up.

270
00:21:39,965 --> 00:21:42,301
She doesn't give up at all.

271
00:21:42,968 --> 00:21:44,970
Dammit.

272
00:21:45,053 --> 00:21:48,765
Yes, if the meteorite collides
into something else first,

273
00:21:48,849 --> 00:21:51,143
then she can hit me with it.

274
00:21:51,226 --> 00:21:53,603
How terrible.

275
00:21:53,687 --> 00:21:57,399
How dare she do
such a terrible thing against me.

276
00:21:57,482 --> 00:21:59,192
This woman…

277
00:22:01,778 --> 00:22:03,447
I choose to look up at the stars.

278
00:22:11,204 --> 00:22:13,665
Match over!

279
00:23:41,336 --> 00:23:46,341
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
